", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Is 935 divisible by 5?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "yes", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "no", "ok": false, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}}, {"k": "method", "t": "How do I test for divisibility?", "p": ["Step 1: Pick the test.", "Step 2: 2, 5, 10: look at the last digit.", "Step 3: 25, 50, 100: look at the last two digits.", "Step 4: Decide yes or no."]}, {"k": "example", "t": "By 2", "p": [], "q": "Is 1357 divisible by 2?", "steps": [["last digit 7 (odd)", ""]], "a": "no"}, {"k": "example", "t": "By 25", "p": [], "q": "Is 1450 divisible by 25?", "steps": [["ends 50", ""]], "a": "yes"}, {"k": "example", "t": "By 100", "p": [], "q": "Is 2050 divisible by 100?", "steps": [["ends 50, not 00", ""]], "a": "no"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Several", "p": [], "q": "Which of 2, 5, 10 divide 85?", "steps": [["ends 5", ""]], "a": "only 5"}, {"k": "try", "t": "By 50", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m4u15s3t03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Is 750 divisible by 50?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "yes", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "no", "ok": false, "fb": ""}], "fixed": true}}, {"k": "error", "t": "Using the last digit for 25", "p": ["Find the first wrong line."], "q": "Is 135 divisible by 25?", "lines": ["ends in 5, so yes"], "bad": 0, "why": "For 25 look at the last two digits: 35 – no.", "fix": [["no", ""]], "id": "m4u15s3t04"}, {"k": "mistake", "t": "Using only the last digit for 25 and 50", "p": ["25, 50, 100 → last two digits."]}, {"k": "tip", "t": "Real life", "p": ["Banks pack coins in 25s and 50s; egg boxes come in 6s and 10s."]}, {"k": "summary", "t": "What to remember", "p": ["2, 5, 10: last digit.", "25, 50, 100: last two digits.", "A number can pass many tests."]}], "video": {"src": null, "offset": 0, "dur": 660, "range": ""}, "stops": [{"id": "15.3-k1", "t": 1, "after": 0, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m4u15s3k01", "t